    "detailed_description": "<h1>Liked it? Support it!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tickled your pickle? Show support by leaving a review, and wishlisting or purchasing:  Thank you in advance, I'm glad Shuffle brought you some enjoyment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search &quot;<strong>Suspicious Shuffle</strong>&quot; on Steam.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>This is the free version of <i>Suspicious Shuffle</i>, it's the full game with no features held back, drag your friends in for a romping good time! Imagine if Mario Party was Co-Op, or if you're kinda old (feels bad man): Pyramid Escape from Warcraft 3.<br><br><strong>Mario Party meets Geometry Wars in this minigame adventure for 1-6 players!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561230/extras/0ad35720dba860f750ed081488f46f52.webp?t=1734832020\" /></span><br>Play through a <strong>1-6 player solo/co-op campaign</strong> (approx. 4-5 hours) utilizing a diverse set of skills in a ever-Shuffling <strong>29</strong> minigame fiesta! In the process, enjoy a light-hearted story involving the Suspicious Dealer and restoring balance to the universe. The stakes have never been lower!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561230/extras/b34069a6980d69cd2905a8a6ed432592.webp?t=1734832020\" /></span><br>Is an adventure really complete without hats? Clearing the campaign rewards you with priceless Stars which can be used to unlock customisation options and get fancy!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561230/extras/dfbf686d870f9f3987f1bec1fdb615e6.webp?t=1734832020\" /></span><br>Sometimes we all need a break from helping one other to show off and find out who really is the very best. It'll be you, obviously. Prove it over <strong>18</strong> PvP minigames.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561230/extras/98ee3e5bc61e234adda3beff03f598ee.webp?t=1734832020\" /></span><br>Mix and match your favorite minigames with modifiable settings to play them the way <strong>you</strong> like them, no judgement.",
    "about_the_game": "This is the free version of <i>Suspicious Shuffle</i>, it's the full game with no features held back, drag your friends in for a romping good time! Imagine if Mario Party was Co-Op, or if you're kinda old (feels bad man): Pyramid Escape from Warcraft 3.<br><br><strong>Mario Party meets Geometry Wars in this minigame adventure for 1-6 players!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561230/extras/0ad35720dba860f750ed081488f46f52.webp?t=1734832020\" /></span><br>Play through a <strong>1-6 player solo/co-op campaign</strong> (approx. 4-5 hours) utilizing a diverse set of skills in a ever-Shuffling <strong>29</strong> minigame fiesta! In the process, enjoy a light-hearted story involving the Suspicious Dealer and restoring balance to the universe. The stakes have never been lower!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561230/extras/b34069a6980d69cd2905a8a6ed432592.webp?t=1734832020\" /></span><br>Is an adventure really complete without hats? Clearing the campaign rewards you with priceless Stars which can be used to unlock customisation options and get fancy!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561230/extras/dfbf686d870f9f3987f1bec1fdb615e6.webp?t=1734832020\" /></span><br>Sometimes we all need a break from helping one other to show off and find out who really is the very best. It'll be you, obviously. Prove it over <strong>18</strong> PvP minigames.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2561230/extras/98ee3e5bc61e234adda3beff03f598ee.webp?t=1734832020\" /></span><br>Mix and match your favorite minigames with modifiable settings to play them the way <strong>you</strong> like them, no judgement.",
